  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Performance release: 40-77% faster comparisons with 30-55% fewer allocations in common scenarios.\n  - Cached reflection probes and compiled dispatch delegates for collections, dictionaries and equality operators (no MethodInfo.Invoke on hot paths).\n  - Removed per-call allocations: lazy distinction lists, strategy singletons, same-reference fast path, single-pass dictionary comparison.\n  - Bounded growth of property-path caches for indexed paths (e.g. Items[123].Name).\n  - Fixed: members declared as a base type holding derived instances were reported as not equal even when the inherited == operator considered them equal.",
